1
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,520
This kind of hyper-vigilance,

2
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,680
nightmares,

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,640
and involuntarily flinching at sudden noises,

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,840
these are all

5
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,320
classic symptoms of PTSD,

6
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,080
post-traumatic stress disorder.

7
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,680
Your nervous system

8
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,400
seems to be stuck in a state of high alert,

9
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,440
as if

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,960
the danger is still present.

11
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,760
I will go back to China and find Ms. Lin

12
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,920
to take back everything that belongs to Jìmíng.

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:30,560
Ma'am,

14
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,000
are you sure you want to

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,040
have this face transplant surgery?

16
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,480
Yes.

17
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:36,600
Okay.

18
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,600
I want a new identity.

19
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,520
As long as the money is right,

20
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,520
everything is negotiable.

21
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,520
I also need a death certificate

22
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,800
and a law degree from LSE.

23
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,680
You...

24
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,280
Guan Tian,

25
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,560
you shameless woman!

26
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,560
Jiming!

27
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,600
Jiming!

28
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,720
So what I just...

29
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:16,480
Liu Yaru,

30
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,360
what's wrong with you?

31
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,480
I'm crazy?

32
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,600
She's a liar.

33
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,680
She doesn't love you at all.

34
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,480
- She... - That's enough.

35
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,640
Who I'm with has nothing to do with you.

36
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,280
Please face reality

37
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,800
and stop doing these embarrassing things.

38
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,520
Tiantian.

39
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:32,760
Jiming.

40
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,120
Jiming, don't go.

41
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,440
Don't leave me.

42
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:45,600
Now,

43
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,800
please leave.

44
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,120
Are you okay?

45
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,760
Slow down.

46
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:30,880
Mom,

47
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,160
what happened to Guan Yu?

48
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:41,680
Oh,

49
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,360
she sprained her ankle.

50
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,600
Let her

51
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,640
stay in the guest room tonight.

52
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,120
Can't walk at all?

53
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,160
Don't go, there's a third cup.

54
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:51,680
Enough.

55
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,120
Stop now.

56
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,000
Sorry, Mr. Wen.

57
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,240
I'm sorry to cause you trouble.

58
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,320
Maybe I should just rest a bit

59
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,200
and go home.

60
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,240
Alright.

61
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,640
Don't force yourself.

62
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,360
We have plenty of guest rooms.

63
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,240
No trouble at all.

64
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,160
Mom,

65
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:17,480
Tian got drunk because Liu Yaru forced her to drink.

66
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,160
Besides,

67
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:19,640
it's so late already.

68
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,040
Alright then.

69
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,760
Take her to the guest room.

70
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,280
Okay.

71
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,160
Thank you, Mr. Wen.

72
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:27,880
Let's go.

73
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:34,440
Be careful.

74
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:45,920
This is your room.

75
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,640
Are you okay?

76
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,640
I'm okay.

77
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,600
Since you've made your choice,

78
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,040
you have to face these.

79
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,520
Are you sure?

80
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,480
Are you ready?

81
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,400
I can do it.

82
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,200
Xintian,

83
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,320
was

84
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,320
the name you shouted

85
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,600
mine?

86
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,880
Wang Jiming is the eldest son of Chairman Lin.

87
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,840
The chairman has always regretted what happened back then

88
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,800
and hoped to take him back

89
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,320
and let him inherit the Lin Group.

90
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,840
It's you.

91
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,960
Guan Yu.

92
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,320
Mr. Wen.

93
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,120
Did I wake you?

94
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,960
I couldn't sleep well.

95
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,120
I have a bit of a headache.

96
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,520
The alcohol probably hasn't worn off yet.

97
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,640
So I thought I'd

98
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,640
come out to get some fresh air.

99
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,600
I really just can't get used to sleeping in the guest room.

100
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,320
Or

101
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,240
are you looking for something?

102
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,040
I have trouble sleeping in unfamiliar beds.

103
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,720
Attorney Guan

104
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,440
I don't care what your purpose is

105
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,760
getting close to Jiming

106
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,200
or whatever it is you're after

107
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,840
The Lin family's door

108
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,880
isn't something you can just walk through whenever you want

109
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,480
Without my approval

110
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,520
it's all just empty talk

111
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,160
Chairman Wen

112
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,080
I understand your concerns

113
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:05,120
But between me and Jiming,

114
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,520
it's not what you think,

115
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,560
full of calculations.

116
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,480
As for the door of the Lin family,

117
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,160
the door is opened for people,

118
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,360
and people don't live for the threshold.

119
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,520
What's important is

120
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,120
whether the people behind the door

121
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,400
are united in heart.

122
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:18,600
Isn't it?

123
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,000
A wife of the Lin family

124
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,480
needs a strong background

125
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,440
and support,

126
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:24,080
not trouble.

127
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,360
I will prove my worth.

128
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,000
What I can bring to Jiming

129
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,680
far outweighs what he would lose.

130
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,400
I will help him protect the Lin Group.

131
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,040
Value

132
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,560
is the eternal pass.

133
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,440
I hope the value of Guan Law

134
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:36,680
can withstand

135
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,160
any scrutiny.

136
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,680
Thank you for your advice.

137
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,480
I'll leave you to it.

138
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,760
I'll go back and rest.

139
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,120
Good night, Mr. Wen.

140
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:35,600
Jiming,

141
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:38,400
Liu Yaping came to me

142
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,560
before she left yesterday

143
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,400
and asked me about you and Yaru.

144
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:43,000
I've calmed her down,

145
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,360
But we still

146
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,480
have to make a stance.

147
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,120
In a few days,

148
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,840
you should personally go to the Liu family

149
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,600
to apologize.

150
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:52,440
And finalize the cooperation details

151
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,200
of the project in the south of the city.

152
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,480
Mom,

153
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,680
I've told you,

154
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,760
Yaru and I...

155
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,760
This is not your personal emotional issue.

156
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,800
It's a business alliance and trust between two families.

157
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,640
The Lin Group is about to go public,

158
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,120
and we need the support of the Liu family

159
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,720
and a clean audit report.

160
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,760
The cost of your caprice

161
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,720
is the interests of the entire group.

162
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,680
Don't be confused

163
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,640
by a momentary

164
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,520
and fleeting temptation.

165
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,720
I'll handle the company's affairs well.

166
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,160
But my marriage

167
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,160
is not a bargaining chip.

168
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,120
Marriage?

169
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,720
Jiming,

170
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,400
you're still too young.

171
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:31,720
Guan Law Firm,

172
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:32,720
what do you think?

173
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,320
As lawyers,

174
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,400
you understand the spirit of contracts the most.

175
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,920
What is more important,

176
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,560
passion or

177
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,000
business interests?

178
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,200
Moreover,

179
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,720
some relationships

180
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,760
are not even contracts.

181
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:47,960
They are just

182
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,800
games between adults.

183
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,240
It's more decent to know

184
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,280
when to quit.

185
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,280
I'm full.

186
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,440
I'll go first.

187
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,160
Mr. Wen,

188
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,440
I'll take my leave.

189
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,800
I'll see you another day.

190
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,480
You were too hasty in your probing that day.

191
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,720
You're an adult.

192
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,320
You should be more composed in handling things.

193
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:28,640
However,

194
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,200
Guan Tiantian

195
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,400
does have issues.

196
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,160
Here's some information

197
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,080
I had gathered.

198
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:43,040
Guan Tiantian,

199
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,720
graduated from LSE in the UK.

200
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:45,640
Her resume

201
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,520
is impressive,

202
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,520
but there's about a year

203
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,680
that's almost blank.

204
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,800
No records of schooling,

205
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:52,560
employment,

206
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,440
or residence.

207
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,880
Her family background

208
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,880
and social relations

209
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:56,720
are also vague.

210
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,400
Blank?

211
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:00,880
Then keep investigating.

212
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,280
Spend whatever it takes.

213
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:04,200
The focus is on that blank period.

214
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:07,280
I will never let her be with Jiming.

215
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,080
To be honest,

216
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,760
I really dislike Lin Jiming.

217
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,600
If it weren't for Dad's last wish,

218
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,400
I'd never let you

219
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,680
marry him.

220
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:19,160
Could you stop targeting him?

221
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,480
He's starting to resent me.

222
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,960
Why are you always siding with him?

223
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,800
He's the one who's targeting me,

224
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,840
not the other way around.

225
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,400
It's you, it's you, it's you!

226
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,320
Enough, enough.

227
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,480
You don't understand

228
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,080
the affairs of the group.

229
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,240
Guan Tian,

230
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,240
leave her to me.

231
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,640
I'll find a way to deal with her

232
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,800
to vent my sister's

233
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,400
anger.

234
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,120
That's more like it.

235
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:53,200
Hey.

236
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:54,120
Jiming,

237
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,120
let's talk.

238
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:55,800
Just five minutes.

239
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,680
I'm busy right now.

240
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,840
There's an emergency meeting

241
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:59,960
regarding Guan Tiantian.

242
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:02,120
She must have ulterior motives in approaching you.

243
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:03,080
I've investigated her.

244
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:03,720
Her background...

245
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,640
You investigated her?

246
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,880
I did it for your sake

247
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,400
and for the company's.

248
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,920
In her overseas study record,

249
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,040
there's a blank period.

250
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:15,680
And her background is suspiciously clean.

251
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,280
Also, don't you think

252
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,440
every single case she's handled

253
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:20,600
seems to be targeting the Lin family?

254
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:21,960
I don't need you meddling in my affairs.

255
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,000
And I especially don't want

256
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,680
you meddling the way you did last night.

257
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:27,440
I...

258
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:49,320
Does your father live here too?

259
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:50,600
I haven't seen him.

260
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:52,640
Since my dad had a stroke,

261
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,960
he's been in a sterile room

262
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:55,760
on the top floor,

263
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,720
and also goes to the hospital regularly.

264
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,520
I rarely see him.

265
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
[Where]

266
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,360
[is Lin Muyun hiding?]
